%% Sequence Diagram — Search + Filter patients — Logical level
%% QT-CR-01
%% Updated: 2026-05-22 (lifelines = logical components, messages = business actions —
%% no class names, no SQL, no Specification API)

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant V as Patient list (Client)
    participant API as Patient API (Server)
    participant BIZ as Patient business rules
    participant STORE as Patient storage

    U->>V: Type keyword and choose filters<br/>(status, gender, department, …)
    V->>API: Search patients<br/>(keyword + filters + page)
    API->>BIZ: Search patients with the given criteria
    Note over BIZ: Combine the criteria that the user<br/>actually filled in (skip empty ones)
    BIZ->>STORE: Find matching patients,<br/>return the requested page
    STORE-->>BIZ: Matching patients + total count
    BIZ-->>API: Page of patients
    API-->>V: Page of patients + pagination info
    V-->>U: Show table, page navigation,<br/>and total result count
